1
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:57,040
Yoo Jung!

2
00:01:20,410 --> 00:01:23,050
I miss you.

3
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:24,420
You're still the same,

4
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:27,360
but I'm getting old.

5
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:30,960
I'm afraid that I might forget you.

6
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:32,840
I'm afraid of being that kind of person.

7
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:36,420
What should I do?

8
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:31,160
Where is San?

9
00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:36,040
Is he okay?

10
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:39,160
Let's get in the car.

11
00:02:45,110 --> 00:02:47,520
Do Hoon, what about my dad?

12
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,780
He's at a nursing home.

13
00:02:48,780 --> 00:02:51,770
Let's go to see him now.

14
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:58,430
Can we go get San first?

15
00:02:58,430 --> 00:03:02,480
He might have forgotten my face.

16
00:03:14,510 --> 00:03:17,030
What?

17
00:03:18,830 --> 00:03:27,460
Nothing. I just can't believe that you're here with me.

18
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:43,750
When you told me that your mother visited San at the orphanage,

19
00:03:43,750 --> 00:03:47,600
I was hoping that she could bring him to me.

20
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:52,200
But I thought it's not a good place for him to visit.

21
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:54,810
Outside is much better anyway.

22
00:03:54,810 --> 00:03:57,710
That's what I told myself.

23
00:03:57,710 --> 00:04:00,050
How are you?

24
00:04:00,050 --> 00:04:03,160
Fine.

25
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:05,990
I guess San is a big boy now.

26
00:04:05,990 --> 00:04:09,110
Babies grow every day.

27
00:04:09,110 --> 00:04:12,670
Did you take lots of pictures?

28
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:17,450
Why didn't you send me any?

29
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:51,220
He had septicemia

30
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:54,810
When they contacted me...

31
00:05:14,530 --> 00:05:16,710
San!

32
00:05:16,710 --> 00:05:19,000
San!

33
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,310
San!

34
00:05:20,310 --> 00:05:21,330
Don't do this.

35
00:05:21,330 --> 00:05:24,160
Let me go! You're lying.

36
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,850
He's not dead.

37
00:05:26,850 --> 00:05:29,510
Bring San back to me.

38
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:32,800
Yoo Jung! Listen to me!

39
00:05:35,850 --> 00:05:39,030
Do Hoon! I need to find San.

40
00:05:39,030 --> 00:05:41,860
We need to find him.

41
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:44,280
San is dead! He's dead!

42
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:47,220
You're lying! Stop lying!

43
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:49,290
I knew you would be desperated.

44
00:05:49,290 --> 00:05:52,550
I knew how sad you are.

45
00:05:52,550 --> 00:05:53,970
I did it all for you.

46
00:05:53,970 --> 00:05:57,790
I lied to you to save you.

47
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:32,320
My mother said she scattered his ashes here.

48
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,480
It's also my first time here.

49
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:38,770
I couldn't conjure up the courage to come myself.

50
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:51,710
I'm sorry that I didn't tell you earlier.

51
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:22,210
Stop!

52
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:25,870
So troublesome.

53
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:29,630
How dare they come to my house?

54
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:31,130
Darn it!

55
00:07:31,130 --> 00:07:33,020
Father!

56
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:34,780
You scared me.

57
00:07:34,780 --> 00:07:37,200
Why didn't you tell us?

58
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:42,060
I had to fool you first to fool the prosecutors.

59
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:45,800
Se Yeon, I'm glad you're here.

60
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:48,370
You know that K Hotel bid for the official hotel

61
00:07:48,370 --> 00:07:51,340
for the World Forum.

62
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:52,090
Yes.

63
00:07:52,090 --> 00:07:53,580
This will decide whether K Hotel becomes

64
00:07:53,580 --> 00:07:57,910
a world class hotel or not.

65
00:07:57,910 --> 00:08:01,990
To persuade the judges on this bid,

66
00:08:01,990 --> 00:08:04,670
I need your help, Se Yeon.

67
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:09,670
Prepare together with Se Yeon.

68
00:08:13,570 --> 00:08:16,530
You should've told me earlier.

69
00:08:16,530 --> 00:08:20,720
Then where were you so early in the morning?

70
00:08:24,380 --> 00:08:26,810
Who's the guy keep investigating us?

71
00:08:26,810 --> 00:08:28,280
It's Ahn Do Hoon,

72
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:29,810
who was in charge of Congressman Kim's investigation.

73
00:08:29,810 --> 00:08:31,490
What?

74
00:08:31,490 --> 00:08:33,850
I'll tell Mr. Yang to handel it.

75
00:08:33,850 --> 00:08:35,640
No.

76
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:38,330
Give him some more time.

77
00:08:38,330 --> 00:08:43,870
Let him squirm enough so we can know if he's a dragon or a snake.

78
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:45,350
How can he be a dragon?

79
00:08:45,350 --> 00:08:48,330
I think he's an earthworm.

80
00:08:48,330 --> 00:08:52,770
An earthworm living in wet, dirty soil.

81
00:08:52,770 --> 00:08:54,700
He'll come out when it rains,

82
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:58,210
we should bake him till death.

83
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:31,330
Shin Se Yeon!

84
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:46,250
Are you still concerned about her?

85
00:09:46,250 --> 00:09:47,750
She already paid for what she did in jail.

86
00:09:47,750 --> 00:09:48,990
Why do you keep on doing this?

87
00:09:48,990 --> 00:09:53,510
How can she pay for a person's life?

88
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:55,720
It's a terrible obsession.

89
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:58,650
What should I do?

90
00:09:58,650 --> 00:10:01,700
I'm still angry.

91
00:10:03,380 --> 00:10:06,520
Why are you so angry?

92
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:09,310
Think about it.

93
00:10:09,310 --> 00:10:12,590
Do you still miss Seo Ji Hee,

94
00:10:12,590 --> 00:10:17,410
or do you want to pass on your guilt to someone else?

95
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:47,310
It's so dirty here.

96
00:10:47,310 --> 00:10:50,000
I can't...

97
00:10:55,430 --> 00:10:59,070
Nobody has lived here for so long.

98
00:10:59,070 --> 00:11:03,200
There is no room for me to stand.

99
00:11:08,860 --> 00:11:12,850
You should eat. Go ahead!

100
00:11:21,730 --> 00:11:24,270
Don't cry.

101
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:30,040
If you're too attached to him, he may not be able to go to heaven.

102
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:32,580
Let him go so that he can be happy in heaven.

103
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:34,680
He has already dead.

104
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:37,800
You should live on as well.

105
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,890
I know how you feel.

106
00:11:42,890 --> 00:11:45,200
I lost my first daughter.

107
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:48,110
She just learnt how to walk.

108
00:11:48,110 --> 00:11:54,420
I was too busy with work to take care of her.

109
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:58,440
I had to make a living.

110
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:01,250
People talked behind my back,

111
00:12:01,250 --> 00:12:03,860
I didn't care what they said.

112
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:06,380
They don't live for me.

113
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:08,660
They only scold me.

114
00:12:08,660 --> 00:12:13,930
No one really cared about me.

115
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:24,240
Yoo Jung, think about your father.

116
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:28,100
You should live on.

117
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:31,430
After getting through this,

118
00:12:31,430 --> 00:12:35,350
there won't be anything that you can't handle.

119
00:12:35,350 --> 00:12:38,650
Trust me.

120
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:50,360
Stop crying.

121
00:13:04,290 --> 00:13:06,520
You'd better go home now.

122
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:09,330
Do you think I'm being mean?

123
00:13:09,330 --> 00:13:11,910
Who do you think Yoo Jung needs the most?

124
00:13:11,910 --> 00:13:14,890
Someone she can cry with?

125
00:13:14,890 --> 00:13:19,350
She needs someone who can make her strong and help her keep on living.

126
00:13:19,350 --> 00:13:20,770
She has to be strong.

127
00:13:20,770 --> 00:13:21,590
I know.

128
00:13:21,590 --> 00:13:23,030
Do you know why...

129
00:13:23,030 --> 00:13:26,230
Please stop.

130
00:13:26,230 --> 00:13:29,580
Give her some time to mourn.

131
00:13:31,140 --> 00:13:33,230
Please go.

132
00:13:33,230 --> 00:13:38,740
You should think about yourself when she gets better.

133
00:13:55,050 --> 00:13:57,940
Isn't it too early to be drinking?

134
00:14:01,580 --> 00:14:05,750
Where is Yoo Jung? Is she okay?

135
00:14:08,640 --> 00:14:11,240
I don't think I can face her.

136
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:14,860
Why?

137
00:14:14,860 --> 00:14:22,300
I just can't understand why she did it.

138
00:14:22,300 --> 00:14:26,110
She is so obedient,

139
00:14:26,110 --> 00:14:28,620
and likes Do Hoon so much.

140
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:31,540
Why didn't she tell Do Hoon about the kid at first?

141
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:34,640
Why did she send him to an orphanage?

142
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:38,510
Is that the Yuejeong I know?

143
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:40,770
How can she be so cruel!

144
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:43,650
Maeybe she didn't dare to see us.

145
00:14:43,650 --> 00:14:46,300
How can she not dare to see us

146
00:14:46,300 --> 00:14:49,620
with such a grandson?

147
00:14:51,790 --> 00:15:00,230
I didn't even have a chance to hold him in my arms.

148
00:15:00,230 --> 00:15:05,620
If I knew he would leave us so soon, I'd have joined you when you visited him.

149
00:15:29,250 --> 00:15:35,940
San, I'm so sorry.

150
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:46,110
I'm sorry that I couldn't protect you.

151
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:50,750
I'm sorry that I had to let you go alone.

152
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:58,120
I'm sorry that I couldn't hold you in my arms.

153
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:09,840
Yoo Jung, eat something, or you would faint.

154
00:16:10,370 --> 00:16:13,620
It's my fault.

155
00:16:13,620 --> 00:16:16,670
San died because of me.

156
00:16:16,670 --> 00:16:19,830
That's nonsense. You didn't kill him.

157
00:16:21,430 --> 00:16:27,100
What should I do? What should I do, Do Hoon?

158
00:16:27,100 --> 00:16:29,950
How can I live without San?

159
00:16:29,950 --> 00:16:32,900
Do Hoon!

160
00:16:33,710 --> 00:16:36,090
I can't live without him.

161
00:16:36,090 --> 00:16:42,020
You should blame me for that.

162
00:16:52,240 --> 00:17:00,340
San! San!

163
00:17:09,530 --> 00:17:13,410
I haven't seen her since she visited the orphanage where her son was.

164
00:17:15,110 --> 00:17:20,130
Do you think I'm too obsessed?

165
00:17:20,130 --> 00:17:23,950
My brother told me not to judge my boss whatever he does.

166
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:31,160
Is that so? I'm confused.

167
00:17:31,510 --> 00:17:37,070
I know this won't bring Ji Hee back.

168
00:17:40,590 --> 00:17:43,440
I guess there's still more I can take from her.

169
00:17:56,590 --> 00:17:58,440
She's coming.

170
00:19:39,610 --> 00:19:42,870
Yoo Jung! Yoo Jung!

171
00:20:05,750 --> 00:20:10,060
Sorry. I'm so sorry, San.

172
00:20:11,410 --> 00:20:13,710
I'm going to stop crying.

173
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:22,520
If I keep crying, you won't be able to sleep, right?

174
00:20:30,090 --> 00:20:32,460
I miss you.

175
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:43,810
I want to touch you and hold you so badly.

176
00:20:46,110 --> 00:20:49,740
It's all my fault.

177
00:21:28,150 --> 00:21:31,570
What?

178
00:21:36,250 --> 00:21:42,210
The stars are so pretty. Right, San?

179
00:22:58,200 --> 00:23:04,060
Yoo Jung, you should've told me before you going somewhere.

180
00:23:04,060 --> 00:23:06,500
I was worried about you.

181
00:23:06,730 --> 00:23:09,500
I was worried that...

182
00:23:16,710 --> 00:23:21,830
Sorry, Do Hoon. I forgot that you're as crushed as I am.

183
00:23:23,780 --> 00:23:27,410
I'm okay. Don't worry about me.

184
00:23:28,900 --> 00:23:33,530
As long as I remember him, he'll stay with us.

185
00:23:35,380 --> 00:23:40,350
Go punish the bad guys, San and I will be proud of you.

186
00:23:41,760 --> 00:23:43,840
Go.

187
00:24:09,860 --> 00:24:14,800
Thank you, San. Mommy is happy.

188
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:18,880
I'm happy because of you.

189
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:25,060
I'll remember you as long as I live.

190
00:24:25,060 --> 00:24:30,610
Mommy will come and see you later.

191
00:24:43,670 --> 00:24:46,910
- You can't go in! - Stop!

192
00:24:53,430 --> 00:25:00,150
Mr. Jo Min Hyuk, we have evidence that suggests you bribed Congressman Kim Chang Suk.

193
00:25:00,150 --> 00:25:03,420
This is a warrant for search and seizure.

194
00:25:03,420 --> 00:25:06,440
- Take all the files and hard disks. - Yes, sir.

195
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:08,660
Get to work!

196
00:25:13,390 --> 00:25:15,940
You've gone too far.

197
00:25:16,550 --> 00:25:21,800
You can't use the knife which is used to kill the dog to kill the owner.

198
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:23,180
What do you think, prosecutor Ahn?

199
00:25:23,180 --> 00:25:27,300
I was about the kill the dog, but then I realized that the owner is much worse.

200
00:25:27,900 --> 00:25:31,910
Catching the owner might help more people.

201
00:25:34,730 --> 00:25:38,640
Sorry to disappoint you, but that's a toy knife.

202
00:25:39,520 --> 00:25:42,160
I didn't want to give the real one to a kid.

203
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:44,080
Depending on who use it,

204
00:25:44,080 --> 00:25:49,020
a toy can also be dangerous.

205
00:25:51,690 --> 00:25:54,060
What is it that you're holding?

206
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:04,690
Give it to me.

207
00:26:06,020 --> 00:26:11,510
I don't mind showing it to you,

208
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:16,210
but you might not like it.

209
00:26:18,760 --> 00:26:21,740
Okay, here you are.

210
00:26:40,500 --> 00:26:43,410
- Hello. - Come back right now!

211
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:48,670
Don't you understand what I'm saying? Stop what you're doing now and come back.

212
00:26:54,600 --> 00:26:57,470
What a pity.

213
00:26:58,300 --> 00:27:02,500
I really wanted to see how you'd react when you see this.

214
00:27:02,840 --> 00:27:05,240
What a pity.

215
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:11,290
If we really want to catch them,

216
00:27:11,290 --> 00:27:14,780
we can dig up dirt on them. That's how we work.

217
00:27:14,780 --> 00:27:17,280
There's a good possibility that

218
00:27:17,340 --> 00:27:21,090
Kim sent the money that he took from the K Corporation to his overseas account.

219
00:27:22,020 --> 00:27:23,800
As long as we stick to K corporation,

220
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:27,070
We can prosecute him for oversees tax evasion,

221
00:27:27,070 --> 00:27:29,510
tax evasion, bribery and embezzlement.

222
00:27:29,840 --> 00:27:34,330
President Jo of the K Corporation didn't show up using illness as an excuse.

223
00:27:34,330 --> 00:27:36,970
If we don't catch him, we'll end up...

224
00:27:37,360 --> 00:27:40,440
But we don't have conclusive evidence.

225
00:27:41,670 --> 00:27:46,810
Why are you obssessed with K Corporation?

226
00:27:47,380 --> 00:27:49,870
Do you bear a deep grudge against them?

227
00:27:50,880 --> 00:27:52,430
It's not like that.

228
00:27:52,470 --> 00:27:56,630
You told me that the criminals would always be our enemies.

229
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:59,900
If we bend our rules depending on who they are...

230
00:27:59,900 --> 00:28:04,070
This is an organization and we have our rules.

231
00:28:04,810 --> 00:28:09,040
If you don't want to listen to me, you can resign.

232
00:28:22,840 --> 00:28:25,260
I've told him.

233
00:28:26,780 --> 00:28:28,480
When he heard that you are coming,

234
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:31,360
he started waiting for you with that bag.

235
00:28:32,170 --> 00:28:34,890
I told him it's too hot to wear the jacket,

236
00:28:34,890 --> 00:28:37,910
but he insisted on...

237
00:28:45,040 --> 00:28:46,920
Dad!

238
00:28:50,660 --> 00:28:53,430
You're here. Are you tired?

239
00:28:54,270 --> 00:28:58,210
What? Are you tired after work?

240
00:29:05,980 --> 00:29:09,590
No. Not at all.

241
00:29:10,820 --> 00:29:13,560
Let's go home. I'm hungry.

242
00:29:16,500 --> 00:29:22,450
Dad. Do you know what the date is today?

243
00:29:23,330 --> 00:29:26,600
Your birthday is coming up.

244
00:29:26,600 --> 00:29:29,340
Do you remember when your birthday is?

245
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:37,480
I'm hungry.

246
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:45,300
Right. You don't have to remember.

247
00:29:46,170 --> 00:29:49,590
I'll remember your birthday.

248
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:55,860
You can just smile.

249
00:30:05,690 --> 00:30:10,300
- Can you take care of this? - You have a visitor.

250
00:30:15,770 --> 00:30:17,740
What are you doing here?

251
00:30:19,550 --> 00:30:23,670
Do I surprise you with my sudden visit?

252
00:30:24,350 --> 00:30:27,650
You came to me without an appointment.

253
00:30:31,560 --> 00:30:33,240
If you're talking about the warrant...

254
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:35,530
I don't care about that.

255
00:30:35,970 --> 00:30:37,610
Do you know what Kang Yoo Jung is doing now?

256
00:30:37,610 --> 00:30:40,030
You already stopped her getting her parole.

257
00:30:40,250 --> 00:30:43,810
- What do you want to do? - You can't say that.

258
00:30:43,810 --> 00:30:48,640
You're the one who stopped her parole.

259
00:30:55,580 --> 00:30:59,990
- How about having dinner together? - I already have plans.

260
00:30:59,990 --> 00:31:03,160
Who's your date?

261
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:05,720
I don't want to share my private life with you.

262
00:31:05,720 --> 00:31:09,160
I thought we were friends.

263
00:31:10,270 --> 00:31:14,920
- Do you keep secrets from your friends? - Mr. Jo Min Hyuk!

264
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:18,570
Shina Foundation is hosting a charity event next week.

265
00:31:19,170 --> 00:31:23,210
You can't meet those guests easily.

266
00:31:23,210 --> 00:31:25,410
Make some connections.

267
00:31:25,410 --> 00:31:29,380
I don't know how long those kinds of connections will last.

268
00:31:29,760 --> 00:31:31,850
Take it easy.

269
00:31:31,850 --> 00:31:34,740
I don't want to wrangle with you.

270
00:31:34,740 --> 00:31:37,930
I just want to be friends with you.

271
00:31:38,230 --> 00:31:40,600
I'll forget the thing

272
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:44,840
that you came to me with a warrant.

273
00:31:46,720 --> 00:31:49,470
You've never been rejected, have you?

274
00:31:49,470 --> 00:31:52,320
If you get bored, you give up.

275
00:31:52,320 --> 00:31:55,010
If you fail, you find a new project.

276
00:31:55,010 --> 00:32:00,430
You and I are completely different. We can never be friends.

277
00:32:08,390 --> 00:32:11,950
Really? Let me think about it.

278
00:32:11,950 --> 00:32:15,040
Are we really that different?

279
00:32:42,740 --> 00:32:44,750
Yoo Jung!

280
00:32:53,520 --> 00:32:55,880
This isn't the same as before.

281
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:59,670
After automatic fare collection system was introdued, many emplyees left.

282
00:33:00,740 --> 00:33:02,430
Right.

283
00:33:02,430 --> 00:33:05,010
How come you haven't contacted me?

284
00:33:07,160 --> 00:33:11,490
Hae Ri left just after you quit.

285
00:33:11,490 --> 00:33:13,990
She thought she could have a better life.

286
00:33:13,990 --> 00:33:18,890
Can you contact Hae Ri?

287
00:33:33,030 --> 00:33:36,970
Hello, I'm applying for the job you advertised on the newspaper.

288
00:33:45,700 --> 00:33:48,270
Thank you. I'll see you tomorrow.

289
00:33:58,670 --> 00:34:00,150
Do I have to go?

290
00:34:00,150 --> 00:34:02,490
We'll open up a casino in our Hong Kong branch.

291
00:34:02,530 --> 00:34:05,260
We need permission from the Hong Kong tourism organization.

292
00:34:05,560 --> 00:34:07,990
Remember. Our goal is not to simply run a casino.

293
00:34:08,030 --> 00:34:09,840
We're introducing the casino to them.

294
00:34:09,870 --> 00:34:13,660
I know. But why do you need me there?

295
00:34:13,700 --> 00:34:15,740
You're going by yourself this time.

296
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:17,520
What about you?

297
00:34:17,550 --> 00:34:21,650
If you make it, your father will be very proud of you.

298
00:34:21,690 --> 00:34:23,240
Why? This is no fun.

299
00:34:23,270 --> 00:34:25,080
Fun?

300
00:34:25,750 --> 00:34:29,150
You seem to live for fun.

301
00:34:29,490 --> 00:34:32,690
Do something useful.

302
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:34,360
Take good care of him.

303
00:34:34,390 --> 00:34:35,870
Yes.

304
00:34:37,490 --> 00:34:40,790
Hey! Hey!

305
00:34:49,470 --> 00:34:51,140
We haven't met each other for a while.

306
00:34:51,580 --> 00:34:54,190
You stopped volunteering at the prison.

307
00:34:54,190 --> 00:34:56,760
I've been busy.

308
00:34:56,760 --> 00:35:00,120
Are you too busy to come to my art gallery?

309
00:35:00,120 --> 00:35:01,150
Sorry?

310
00:35:05,370 --> 00:35:09,870
Please come. You can make time if you want to.

311
00:35:13,110 --> 00:35:14,650
Do you paint as well?

312
00:35:14,650 --> 00:35:17,410
Hello. You're here.

313
00:35:19,540 --> 00:35:22,090
I'll be expecting you.

314
00:35:24,460 --> 00:35:25,240
How are you?

315
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:26,640
Fine.

316
00:35:26,640 --> 00:35:30,030
You've been busy doing charity work.

317
00:35:30,030 --> 00:35:33,280
It's not my project. I'm just helping my dad.

318
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:34,560
Are you coming to the party?

319
00:35:34,560 --> 00:35:37,470
Of course.

320
00:35:37,470 --> 00:35:40,480
How dare you come here?

321
00:35:54,700 --> 00:35:58,710
I really want to kill you.

322
00:35:58,710 --> 00:36:01,110
How dare you?

323
00:36:02,510 --> 00:36:04,150
Sorry.

324
00:36:04,150 --> 00:36:16,220
Ji Hee! My daughter.

325
00:36:19,750 --> 00:36:26,140
My poor daughter!

326
00:36:31,040 --> 00:36:36,150
Why do you come to torture me?

327
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:55,310
What are these?

328
00:36:55,920 --> 00:36:58,250
Seo Ji Hee's mother sent these.

329
00:37:03,670 --> 00:37:08,720
I'm sending back the money and the presents you gave me.

330
00:37:08,720 --> 00:37:10,630
I don't figure out who sent these,

331
00:37:10,630 --> 00:37:13,520
so it took me a long time to send them back.

332
00:37:13,520 --> 00:37:19,460
I don't think my daughter would want this.

333
00:37:23,940 --> 00:37:26,320
What can I do for her?

334
00:37:28,350 --> 00:37:32,930
She won't take the house that I bought for her.

335
00:37:32,930 --> 00:37:36,240
She doesn't want anything from me.

336
00:37:36,690 --> 00:37:40,800
How do you think I can make Ji Hee happy?

337
00:38:13,410 --> 00:38:14,820
What are you doing here?

338
00:38:14,820 --> 00:38:17,640
Can't you just say hello?

339
00:38:17,640 --> 00:38:20,010
Do I need an excuse to see you?

340
00:38:21,970 --> 00:38:25,330
Is this for your exhibition?

341
00:38:25,680 --> 00:38:27,580
It's not finished.

342
00:38:27,580 --> 00:38:29,620
You can see it later.

343
00:38:42,740 --> 00:38:44,640
What's bothering you?

344
00:38:44,640 --> 00:38:50,670
How do you know that I'm troubled?

345
00:38:50,670 --> 00:38:52,560
I've known you for such a long time.

346
00:38:52,560 --> 00:38:58,150
I'm in a bad mood, but I don't know why.

347
00:39:00,150 --> 00:39:02,700
You're a naive man.

348
00:39:02,700 --> 00:39:06,520
Whether it's your anger toward her or your guilt,

349
00:39:06,520 --> 00:39:08,610
forgive her and yourself.

350
00:39:08,610 --> 00:39:10,680
Just let it go.

351
00:39:10,680 --> 00:39:13,240
I wish it were that simple.

352
00:39:18,020 --> 00:39:19,300
Stop!

353
00:39:19,300 --> 00:39:21,390
Wait a moment.

354
00:39:21,390 --> 00:39:22,220
Stop!

355
00:39:22,220 --> 00:39:23,930
Please stay still.

356
00:39:23,930 --> 00:39:25,520
What are you doing?

357
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:31,960
It's dangerous for him to go out alone.

358
00:39:31,960 --> 00:39:34,900
This has his information on it.

359
00:39:34,900 --> 00:39:39,520
He can't take it off on his own.

360
00:39:39,520 --> 00:39:41,500
- Just wati a minute. - No.

361
00:39:41,500 --> 00:39:42,560
Please stay still.

362
00:39:42,560 --> 00:39:45,740
You need this if you want to live with Yoo Jung.

363
00:39:45,740 --> 00:39:47,580
It's ugly.

364
00:39:47,580 --> 00:39:51,310
What do you mean? It's pretty.

365
00:39:51,310 --> 00:39:57,550
Look, dad! Isn't it pretty?

366
00:39:57,550 --> 00:40:01,500
This is our phone number.

367
00:40:06,350 --> 00:40:08,160
Pretty.

368
00:40:15,100 --> 00:40:17,140
What happened?

369
00:40:17,140 --> 00:40:18,830
You're all wet.

370
00:40:20,560 --> 00:40:23,180
I spilled something.

371
00:40:31,130 --> 00:40:32,450
I'll go have a shower.

372
00:40:32,450 --> 00:40:33,470
OK.

373
00:40:33,470 --> 00:40:37,710
Lie down here.

374
00:40:58,610 --> 00:41:01,560
It's late. Aren't you going home?

375
00:42:03,810 --> 00:42:05,360
This is...

376
00:42:16,190 --> 00:42:21,570
That's okay. It doesn't hurt any more.

377
00:42:22,790 --> 00:42:25,520
It's not okay, you fool!

378
00:42:30,670 --> 00:42:31,710
I'm sorry.

379
00:42:31,710 --> 00:42:34,330
Don't be. It's not your fault.

380
00:42:34,330 --> 00:42:37,550
It's all my fault.

381
00:42:43,680 --> 00:42:46,100
Answer your phone.

382
00:43:04,010 --> 00:43:06,370
I'll try harder.

383
00:43:06,710 --> 00:43:12,990
I know you've been taking care of my father. I really appreciate it.

384
00:43:14,670 --> 00:43:16,700
I'll visit your parents soon.

385
00:43:16,700 --> 00:43:22,140
I haven't visited them after coming out of jail.

386
00:43:22,140 --> 00:43:23,780
I'm sorry.

387
00:43:23,780 --> 00:43:25,570
You'll be tired.

388
00:43:26,230 --> 00:43:27,930
I know.

389
00:43:29,420 --> 00:43:30,400
Sorry.

390
00:43:30,400 --> 00:43:33,110
Why do you keep on saying sorry?

391
00:43:33,110 --> 00:43:35,230
Stop saying sorry.

392
00:43:36,130 --> 00:43:41,700
Sorry, no, no.

393
00:43:45,180 --> 00:43:53,010
I got a job. I'll start working tomorrow.

394
00:44:36,160 --> 00:44:38,050
What do you want to do?

395
00:44:38,050 --> 00:44:41,490
Are you going to marry her?

396
00:44:41,490 --> 00:44:44,150
I told you it's over after she's better.

397
00:44:44,150 --> 00:44:46,450
No one can blame you.

398
00:44:46,450 --> 00:44:48,580
You've done enough.

399
00:44:48,580 --> 00:44:50,080
Please stop.

400
00:44:50,080 --> 00:44:53,670
Even though she looks okay, she's still in great pain.

401
00:44:53,670 --> 00:44:56,970
You only care about her. You never care about me.

402
00:44:56,970 --> 00:45:03,180
It's all my fault. Yoo Jung and you.

403
00:45:03,180 --> 00:45:06,300
Look! She's the one who should be blamed.

404
00:45:06,300 --> 00:45:08,320
It's not her fault.

405
00:45:08,320 --> 00:45:11,770
Then is it my fault?

406
00:45:11,770 --> 00:45:14,820
I did everything to support you.

407
00:45:14,820 --> 00:45:19,110
I know what you've done for me. Please stop.

408
00:45:21,230 --> 00:45:26,780
How can you...

409
00:45:26,780 --> 00:45:31,500
Honey.

410
00:45:31,500 --> 00:45:34,750
What have you said to your mom?

411
00:45:35,450 --> 00:45:40,070
I'm going to die.

412
00:45:40,070 --> 00:45:43,210
I've done everything, yet he still blames me.

413
00:45:43,210 --> 00:45:44,730
Calm down.

414
00:45:53,370 --> 00:45:56,090
You called him San?

415
00:46:05,160 --> 00:46:15,580
My heart breaks when I think about him,

416
00:46:15,580 --> 00:46:23,070
but this might be the time to end this relationship.

417
00:46:26,260 --> 00:46:30,450
Although you supprt each other now,

418
00:46:30,450 --> 00:46:39,230
the kid will haunt both of you.

419
00:46:39,230 --> 00:46:41,610
What if he were still alive?

420
00:46:41,610 --> 00:46:43,850
Would it be different?

421
00:46:43,850 --> 00:46:48,380
Can I marry her?

422
00:46:48,380 --> 00:46:49,740
No.

423
00:46:50,600 --> 00:46:53,900
Even if you two marry because of San,

424
00:46:53,900 --> 00:46:56,870
who would bless your marriage?

425
00:46:57,190 --> 00:46:59,920
You're going to have to lie about Yoo Jung

426
00:46:59,920 --> 00:47:04,140
to your colleagues.

427
00:47:04,140 --> 00:47:08,920
You'll end up quarreling with each other,

428
00:47:08,920 --> 00:47:12,860
it brings you nothing but sorrow.

429
00:47:12,860 --> 00:47:15,910
You and Yoo Jung weren't meant to be together.

430
00:47:31,350 --> 00:47:34,810
Excuse me? More wine?

431
00:47:40,430 --> 00:47:43,500
Your girlfriend is so pretty.

432
00:47:45,890 --> 00:47:48,890
Enjoy your flight.

433
00:48:19,240 --> 00:48:23,760
You should tell us the truth. Customers don't like it.

434
00:48:32,470 --> 00:48:33,360
Hello.

435
00:48:33,360 --> 00:48:35,500
Ms. Kang Yoo Jung? It's ‘Hangyeong Service.'

436
00:48:35,500 --> 00:48:36,650
Yes?

437
00:48:36,650 --> 00:48:40,690
Can you work as a waitress at K Art Center tomorrow night?

438
00:48:40,690 --> 00:48:43,180
Sure. Thank you so much.

439
00:49:02,930 --> 00:49:07,280
Prosecutor Ahn? You're coming tonight, right?

440
00:49:07,280 --> 00:49:10,280
I didn't say that I'd be there.

441
00:49:10,280 --> 00:49:12,010
I think you should.

442
00:49:12,010 --> 00:49:14,000
What do you mean?

443
00:49:14,000 --> 00:49:15,730
I'm your friend.

444
00:49:15,730 --> 00:49:18,280
Why don't you trust me?

445
00:49:23,010 --> 00:49:25,050
If you're invited, just go.

446
00:49:25,050 --> 00:49:28,170
It's just a charity event.

447
00:49:28,170 --> 00:49:35,270
Even the busiest prosecutors would attend that party.

448
00:49:35,560 --> 00:49:39,050
Why are you so hesitated?

449
00:49:56,810 --> 00:50:01,480
I'm jealous that Min Hyuk love you so much,

450
00:50:03,320 --> 00:50:07,510
It's been 4 years since you passed away.

451
00:50:07,610 --> 00:50:10,940
I think I've been patient enough.

452
00:50:15,270 --> 00:50:22,260
Please let Min Hyuk go.

453
00:50:23,440 --> 00:50:26,420
Please.

454
00:50:31,390 --> 00:50:35,730
I'll tell my feeling to Min Hyuk today.

455
00:50:53,390 --> 00:50:54,590
Excuse me!

456
00:51:02,500 --> 00:51:03,440
Yoo Jung!

457
00:51:06,840 --> 00:51:10,470
Unbelievable! Where have you been?

458
00:51:14,640 --> 00:51:16,430
Are you ready?

459
00:51:20,960 --> 00:51:22,840
When did you change the job?

460
00:51:22,840 --> 00:51:24,920
Right after you left.

461
00:51:24,920 --> 00:51:28,480
I was thinking about why I always ended up with bastards.

462
00:51:28,480 --> 00:51:30,040
I needed to change my environment.

463
00:51:30,040 --> 00:51:32,830
I didn't have to suffer in a big sea.

464
00:51:32,830 --> 00:51:34,280
To catch one good fish.

465
00:51:34,280 --> 00:51:37,670
There are lots of good fish here.

466
00:51:37,670 --> 00:51:40,790
Have you caught one?

467
00:51:42,180 --> 00:51:48,900
I have baited my hook, but none of them biting.

468
00:51:49,910 --> 00:51:55,000
They have parties thanks to their rich parents.

469
00:51:55,310 --> 00:51:57,580
What am I doing here?

470
00:51:58,580 --> 00:52:01,450
Do you know who will be here today?

471
00:52:01,450 --> 00:52:06,390
A rich princess of the Shina Foundation is hosting a charity party.

472
00:52:06,390 --> 00:52:10,680
I guess all of the guests will be rich.

473
00:52:10,890 --> 00:52:13,700
I'm poor. They should help me.

474
00:52:13,700 --> 00:52:16,780
The time is limited. Let's hurry up.

475
00:52:20,240 --> 00:52:22,850
- Hello, Prosecutor Ahn! - Hello.

476
00:52:22,850 --> 00:52:25,140
Thank you for coming.

477
00:53:03,720 --> 00:53:05,880
Hello.

478
00:53:05,880 --> 00:53:07,300
Congratulations.

479
00:53:17,140 --> 00:53:18,410
What are you doing?

480
00:53:23,140 --> 00:53:25,030
Is this your new job?

481
00:53:25,030 --> 00:53:27,790
No, this is my temp job.

482
00:53:27,790 --> 00:53:30,230
What are you doing here?

483
00:53:30,570 --> 00:53:35,350
I was invited. Lots of lawyers were invited.

484
00:53:38,850 --> 00:53:44,370
It would embarrass you if I work here.

485
00:53:49,660 --> 00:53:54,620
I haven't prepared dinner for my dad, he must be hungry now.

486
00:53:54,620 --> 00:53:57,290
I have to go now.

487
00:53:57,630 --> 00:53:59,170
Yoo Jung!

488
00:54:03,320 --> 00:54:06,230
I'll help you to find a job where you can work daytime.

489
00:54:06,230 --> 00:54:10,270
Go home and take care of your father.

490
00:54:10,270 --> 00:54:13,720
Okay. I'll go now.

491
00:54:25,140 --> 00:54:27,240
- Hello. - Congratulations!

492
00:54:27,240 --> 00:54:30,530
Thank you. Enjoy your meal.

493
00:54:43,550 --> 00:54:46,750
- Do Hoon. - Hello.

494
00:54:46,750 --> 00:54:47,990
Why are you alone?

495
00:54:47,990 --> 00:54:49,130
Sorry?

496
00:54:49,130 --> 00:54:54,040
I saw you with a girl earlier. Who is she?

497
00:54:55,320 --> 00:54:58,520
You don't want to talk about it?

498
00:54:59,900 --> 00:55:02,140
Am I right?

499
00:55:06,340 --> 00:55:08,830
It's good to see you here.

500
00:55:09,210 --> 00:55:12,170
Why did you invite me here?

501
00:55:12,480 --> 00:55:15,150
Please be patient.

502
00:55:15,150 --> 00:55:19,480
You're here because you're curious, right?

503
00:55:19,980 --> 00:55:26,900
Curiosity kill the cat.

504
00:55:27,640 --> 00:55:29,720
Curiosity.

505
00:55:29,720 --> 00:55:31,210
Hey!

506
00:55:31,810 --> 00:55:35,920
I heard that you went to Hong Kong.

507
00:55:36,040 --> 00:55:39,610
Yes. I went there for work. You wouldn't believe me though.

508
00:55:41,320 --> 00:55:43,570
Did you have fun?

509
00:55:43,570 --> 00:55:45,140
Jo Min Hyuk!

510
00:55:46,720 --> 00:55:49,820
Can you stay until the end today?

511
00:55:49,820 --> 00:55:54,470
No. I don't want to stay at this boring party.

512
00:55:54,470 --> 00:55:57,670
Please try. I have something for you.

513
00:55:57,670 --> 00:55:59,280
What is it? Give it to me now.

514
00:55:59,280 --> 00:56:01,750
- No. - What is it?

515
00:56:01,750 --> 00:56:04,120
If you're curious, then wait.

516
00:56:04,150 --> 00:56:07,640
Only you can get it.

517
00:56:09,750 --> 00:56:11,730
It must be something special.

518
00:56:11,730 --> 00:56:16,240
It'll be fun. You like having fun, right?

519
00:56:18,090 --> 00:56:22,760
Min Hyuk, I'm serious.

520
00:56:23,000 --> 00:56:25,740
Stick around until the end.

521
00:56:31,010 --> 00:56:32,520
See you later.

522
00:56:38,620 --> 00:56:41,650
It hurts! Stop it! It hurts!

523
00:56:43,530 --> 00:56:46,390
I have to do this.

524
00:56:46,390 --> 00:56:49,860
Look how dirty you are!

525
00:56:49,860 --> 00:56:53,980
If people see you like this, they'll blame me.

526
00:56:56,900 --> 00:56:58,770
One more to go! The last one!

527
00:56:58,770 --> 00:57:00,790
Bad girl!

528
00:57:02,540 --> 00:57:03,940
Who's that?

529
00:57:05,320 --> 00:57:06,660
It's done.

530
00:57:24,020 --> 00:57:25,550
Prosecutor Ahn!

531
00:57:26,990 --> 00:57:29,850
This is Hwang Changwoo, from JNJ Law firm.

532
00:57:29,850 --> 00:57:33,300
You said he was your role model.

533
00:57:34,160 --> 00:57:36,980
Prosecutor Ahn, I've heard a lot about you.

534
00:57:36,980 --> 00:57:38,770
It's an honor to meet you.

535
00:57:38,770 --> 00:57:41,550
I was impressed by the way you dealt with Congressman Kim's Case,

536
00:57:41,550 --> 00:57:44,320
and the K Corporation.

537
00:57:44,320 --> 00:57:47,290
You're ambitious. I like that.

538
00:57:47,290 --> 00:57:48,970
Thank you.

539
00:57:48,970 --> 00:57:51,730
We're going to form a global team,

540
00:57:51,730 --> 00:57:55,740
and I was planning to meet you to discuss that.

541
00:57:55,740 --> 00:57:57,850
I'll see you later.

542
00:58:00,540 --> 00:58:03,090
I told you that you wouldn't regret it.

543
00:58:13,490 --> 00:58:16,760
Where is Kang Yoo Jung? She's not here yet?

544
00:58:16,940 --> 00:58:18,710
I'll check into it.

545
00:58:18,710 --> 00:58:21,130
Go get her. I'm getting bored.

546
00:58:21,130 --> 00:58:22,410
Okay.

547
01:00:22,270 --> 01:00:27,310
Get out.

548
01:00:27,310 --> 01:00:30,500
You're alive, yet you fooled us all along?

549
01:00:30,500 --> 01:00:35,640
Sorry. Give me some more time. I'll definitely pay you back.

550
01:00:35,640 --> 01:00:38,050
I can sue you for fraud.

551
01:00:38,050 --> 01:00:39,190
Take these away.

552
01:00:39,190 --> 01:00:40,820
Come on!

553
01:00:42,040 --> 01:00:43,640
No! Stop!

554
01:00:45,620 --> 01:00:46,770
What is this?

555
01:00:47,930 --> 01:00:49,020
No!

556
01:00:54,280 --> 01:00:55,400
What is it?

557
01:00:55,770 --> 01:00:57,720
- What is it? - No! NO!

558
01:00:57,720 --> 01:01:00,150
No! Stop.

559
01:01:00,150 --> 01:01:03,520
No, no.

560
01:01:05,270 --> 01:01:07,150
Who are you?

561
01:01:08,670 --> 01:01:10,230
Who the hell are you?

562
01:01:10,420 --> 01:01:11,650
What are you doing?

563
01:01:11,650 --> 01:01:13,360
You can't do everything you want in someone else's house.

564
01:01:13,360 --> 01:01:14,800
Someone else's house?

565
01:01:14,800 --> 01:01:16,540
What? Have they already sold it?

566
01:01:16,540 --> 01:01:17,650
What's going on?

567
01:01:17,650 --> 01:01:19,230
I don't care.

568
01:01:19,230 --> 01:01:23,600
- Kwang Soo, escort them out. - Yes.

569
01:01:23,600 --> 01:01:25,460
Escort them out with respect.

570
01:01:25,460 --> 01:01:26,740
Who are you?

571
01:01:26,740 --> 01:01:28,150
Let me go.

572
01:01:31,270 --> 01:01:32,520
Hey!

573
01:01:32,560 --> 01:01:34,080
Why don't we talk outside?

574
01:01:34,080 --> 01:01:35,260
What are you doing?

575
01:01:35,260 --> 01:01:37,960
Treat them with respect, Kwang Soo.

576
01:01:48,360 --> 01:01:52,080
What are you doing? Who are you?

577
01:01:52,080 --> 01:01:56,760
Me? I'm the owner of this house.

578
01:01:57,920 --> 01:02:00,530
That's the destiny.

579
01:02:01,190 --> 01:02:05,530
I never sold this place. Get out of my house.

580
01:02:05,530 --> 01:02:08,410
I never want to stay here.

581
01:02:09,230 --> 01:02:12,130
I want you out by the end of this week.

582
01:02:12,130 --> 01:02:15,630
If not, you'll be gone with this building.

583
01:02:15,630 --> 01:02:20,130
No way! I've lived here my entire life. You have no right to do that.

584
01:02:20,130 --> 01:02:24,010
Why do you keep torturing me and following me around? Who are you?

585
01:02:24,010 --> 01:02:25,390
Why are you doing this to me?

586
01:02:25,390 --> 01:02:28,920
What a bad person you are to treat me like this.

587
01:02:28,920 --> 01:02:31,700
How can you do this to me?

588
01:02:32,070 --> 01:02:39,760
Do you think what you did was okay?

589
01:02:39,760 --> 01:02:44,300
How did it feel when you walked away from a dying person?

590
01:02:44,300 --> 01:02:46,830
What I've done is nothing.

591
01:02:46,830 --> 01:02:49,930
Compared to what you took away from me.

592
01:02:50,730 --> 01:02:52,390
Hey! Was that you?

593
01:02:52,430 --> 01:02:56,410
You can't just hit people and run away.

594
01:03:01,640 --> 01:03:06,010
How dare you hurt what's mine?

595
01:03:18,820 --> 01:03:24,890
Next on secret love.

596
01:03:27,070 --> 01:03:29,650
You can stop following Kang Yoo Jung around.

597
01:03:29,650 --> 01:03:32,510
Just leave her alone.

598
01:03:33,570 --> 01:03:35,150
Dry your tears.

599
01:03:35,150 --> 01:03:36,580
It's over.

600
01:03:36,580 --> 01:03:39,650
- What? - This marriage.

601
01:03:40,610 --> 01:03:41,700
I'm sorry.

602
01:03:41,700 --> 01:03:44,130
Let me go! Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

603
01:03:44,660 --> 01:03:45,410
Who is it?

604
01:03:45,410 --> 01:03:47,550
You hurt Yoo Jung.

605
01:03:47,550 --> 01:03:49,030
You remember that?

606
01:03:49,030 --> 01:03:50,770
How can I forget.

607
01:03:50,770 --> 01:03:54,400
You think I don't know that Yoo Jung is your scrapegoat?

608
01:03:55,780 --> 01:03:56,810
Hey.

609
01:03:56,810 --> 01:03:57,950
Is there anyone?

610
01:03:57,950 --> 01:04:01,790
Don't die without my permission.
